{
  "DESCRIPTION": "A full-frame dot lattice that sound physically deforms: kicks send radial shockwaves from a jumping origin, onsets tear rows apart sideways, highs jitter and sparkle single points, silence snaps back to a perfect grid; footage only sizes the dots",
